    "chunk_text": "to him bem\u00e6nde Martinus \u00fea sona hine sylfne unscrydde under his ceppan digellice, and dyde on \u00feone \u00feearfan his agen \u00dea \u00e6fter lytlum fyrste com se ercediacon, and cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hit tima w\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t he into cyrcan eode, \u00feam Martinus him cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00fe\u00e6t he ne mihte na gan \u00e6ror to cyrcan, \u00e6r se \u00feearfa w\u00e6re gescryd, and se And \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Martinus, sy \u00fe\u00e6t reaf gebroht hra\u00f0e hider to me, ne ateora\u00f0 us na \u00feearfa to scrydenne. Se ercediacon \u00fea yrsigende eode, and brohte an reaf ungerydelic him to, waclic and lytel, mid lytlan \u00dea n\u00e6s se halga wer for his wordum astyrod, ac het hine anbidian \u00fe\u00e6rute sume hwile, wolde \u00fe\u00e6t he He scrydde hine \u00f0a mid \u00feam ylcan reafe, and eode to cyrcan, and sona m\u00e6ssode. \u00c6t \u00fe\u00e6re ylcan m\u00e6ssan \u00fery munecas gesawon, and an \u00fe\u00e6re preosta, and an of \u00feam nunnum, bufan On \u00feam ylcan timan an w\u00e6r w\u00e6s geuntrumod Euantius gehaten, swy\u00f0e yfele ge\u00feread, and wende him He w\u00e6s swy\u00f0e Cristen, and sende \u00fea to Martine b\u00e6d his neosunge, and se bisceop ferde sona to \u00feam Eft \u00fe\u00e6s on mergen \u00fea Martinus fundode, \u00fea wear\u00f0 an cnapa of \u00fe\u00e6s \u00feegenes hiwr\u00e6dene \u00feurh n\u00e6ddran Se hlaford \u00fea Euantius, gel\u00e6hte \u00feone cnapan, and b\u00e6r to Martine, micclum truwigende \u00fe\u00e6t him Se halga wer",
